From: LuneOS Developers <luneos@webos-ports.org>
Date: Sat, 19 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] shell.pro: Disable hidden symbol visibility for Qt6 plugin

Qt6 automatically applies -fvisibility=hidden when CONFIG += plugin is
set.  This hides DeviceKeyHandler::eventFilter (a virtual QObject
override), causing a runtime undefined-symbol error when CardShell.qml
loads liblunanext-shell-qml.so.

Add CONFIG -= hide_symbols after the plugin CONFIG line so that all
symbols remain visible, matching Qt5 behaviour.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 modules/LunaNext/Shell/shell.pro | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/modules/LunaNext/Shell/shell.pro b/modules/LunaNext/Shell/shell.pro
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/modules/LunaNext/Shell/shell.pro
+++ b/modules/LunaNext/Shell/shell.pro
@@ -4,5 +4,6 @@
 QT += qml quick quick-private
 CONFIG += qt plugin
+CONFIG -= hide_symbols

 CONFIG += link_pkgconfig
 PKGCONFIG += luna-service2 luna-service2++ LunaSysMgrCommon
